0 < 2 """The story preview (skills/ultrawrite/stories/preview.ts and preview/, #1532): a pick names
1 < 2 its piece and the old shape still lands, a malformed path answers 400 not 500, plays run one at
2 < 1 a time, and the page names elements the way the browser checker does. The server legs need bun
3 < 1 and an offline-installable app; the naming leg needs the checker's own browser."""
